Z||000013||1FST2M6||03-20-2001||08:11 AM||||thanks guys! I'm running 17x7s up front (215-45) and a 17x8 (235-40) in the rear. This was out in Dallas about 10 minutes from my house.. or 20 min from the shop. we're going back out there this sunday if it's nice out. it's $10 to get in and run.. stay away from the Pseudo-hot dogs... their $5 and the armpits and @$$holes of the hot dog factory! their really bad! <P>there are a couple tourbo AWD talons running low 7s, mustangs running anythign from high 9s to high 6s. and my Friends 225" Drag-rail runnin 5.80s! @ 130+<P>the peach car on the left on the last pic runs a 427 and nitous he's pulling the tires off the ground and running 6.0s<P>oh and Klown.. yeah it's a single 2.5" brullen exhaust. with 2.5" cat. the single wiper was cause the post is busted off the drivers side in a wreck befroe i bought the GT. yeah it's an automatic... I love it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> just comparing my SEs times slips and the GTs.. this is gunna be a low 15 high 14 second car right now! my SE was running 9.3s-9.4s on nitrous! running 14.0 in the 1/4. on street tires. I'm not too far off that now! <P>I was also REALLY impressed at how consistant it is! she ran a 10.7 with a 1.2rt.. i pulled 2 .0550 lights and a .083 light and still 10.0++<P> <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 03-20-2001).]||||reg||1
